{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"why\": \"H1建立了亲近曾带来安慰，H2、H3则表明，已有的满足并未消除更深的渴望，反而让他更清楚自己还想要更多。因此，原有的满足不足以继续支撑他，而尚未实现的更多又无法提供新的依靠，这种两头落空的状态能够解释S05-B1中支撑突然消失、内心空落、孤单而悬浮的感觉。解释给出了从既有满足与未满足的渴望之间的落差，到失去心理支撑的因果关系，不只是重复听感。其中‘别的可能’应理解为H2、H3中尚未实现的更多，而不是凭空引入其他人物、机会或出路。\",\n  \"coverage_gaps\": [\n    \"S05-B1：时间仿佛松开、漫无目的地游走的感觉虽与‘悬着’相通，但其时间感和方向感的变化尚未得到充分解释。\",\n    \"S05-B2：从两人贴近耳语突然转为沉默、退回自己的内心，以及对幸福真实性和持久性的疑问，尚未得到具体解释。\",\n    \"S05-B3：从用力抱紧、想抓住当下，转为主动松手、深吸一口气，以及紧攥的冲动逐渐退去，尚未解释。\"\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4ec3cf3c-817b-40d9-a9dc-760c3c2326af", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T045609836894Z", "elapsed_seconds": 32.516, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T04:56:42.363927+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "878c6a9deddd25ff50384c095195130d17e0ace4d8106d79f8428fd261fe2128", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33